Description-it.utf-8: Area geografica:
Description-ja.utf-8: 地理的領域:
Description-ku.utf-8: Qada cografîk
Description-lt.utf-8: Geografinė zona:
Description-ml.utf-8: ഭൂമിശാത്രപരമായ ഭാഗം:
